# Cloudflare Pages — Reverse Proxy Redirects (Optional)
# If you want Cloudflare Pages to proxy API and upload requests to Render,
# rename this file to "_redirects" (without .example) and replace YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE
# with your actual Render service URL (e.g. ocf-api.onrender.com).
#
# /api/*      https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE.onrender.com/api/:splat  200
# /uploads/*  https://YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE.onrender.com/uploads/:splat  200
